---
description: VersionGhost invariants for AI-assisted repository edits
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do not edit `sample_app/liveops_service/client_contracts/` to make a code change pass.
- Do not weaken or delete compatibility checks as a repair strategy.
- Prefer small, reversible changes and explain which requirement each change satisfies.
- Run `python -m pytest -q` before completion.
- Run `python -m versionghost.cli demo` before completion and inspect the merge-packet verdict.
- Never claim an external model/deployment was used unless a run artifact proves it.
